---
const ja = Astro.props.lang === 'ja';
---
<section class="v3-try" aria-labelledby="try-title">
  <div class="v3-section-heading"><h2 id="try-title" set:html={ja ? 'まず、Rubyで<wbr>応答を変えてみる。' : 'Start with one request and one Ruby handler.'} /><p>{ja ? '最初はmodel APIのキーが不要なHelloの例から。nginxがRubyを呼ぶ最小構成を動かし、その後でモデルの振り分けへ進みます。' : 'Begin with the Hello example; no model API key is needed. Run the smallest nginx-to-Ruby setup, then extend that handler into model routing.'}</p></div>
  <p class="try-prerequisite">{ja ? 'Docker Composeとgit、curlを用意し、nextブランチのexamples/startで実行します。初回はソースのビルドが必要です。' : 'Use Docker Compose, git and curl in examples/start from the next branch. The first run builds nginx and mruby from source.'}</p>
  <div class="try-path" role="list"><div role="listitem"><h3>{ja ? '起動する' : 'Start nginx'}</h3><code>docker compose up --build --wait</code></div><div role="listitem"><h3>{ja ? 'Rubyを書き換える' : 'Edit the handler'}</h3><code>hello.rb</code><span>{ja ? 'Helloを別の挨拶に変更' : 'Change Hello to another greeting'}</span></div><div role="listitem"><h3>{ja ? '応答の変化を見る' : 'See the new response'}</h3><code>curl localhost:8080/hello</code><span>{ja ? 'cacheなしの例では、次のリクエストに反映' : 'Without cache, the next request reads your edit'}</span></div></div>
  <div class="try-options"><a class="button-primary" href={ja ? '/ja/start/' : '/start/'}>{ja ? '取得・起動・終了の手順' : 'Open the complete setup walkthrough'}</a><a href={ja ? '/ja/guides/install/' : '/guides/install/'}>{ja ? 'Linuxへ組み込む場合' : 'Installing into nginx on Linux'}</a></div>
</section>
